trunk.  The expected output of MultiLineLiterals.tc was not updated when
4 ⎕CR started marking some items inside nested values with ∼, and
ZZ59_Regression.tc defined a function with a leading blank in its body
line, which 2.0 keeps, while the expected output assumes it is dropped.

